  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating Disability Rights in Cambodia (ADRC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the successful completion of Phase I, under the Phase II, UNESCO will adopt and localize the UNESCO Practical Manual on Disability Equality in the Media and promote its implementation by media houses and organizations to promote inclusive and accessible content production for persons with disabilities. UNESCO will further equip persons with disabilities with digital, media and information literacy skills to better navigate and participate in the digital space. The project is part of the UN Joint initiative &quot;Accelerating Disability Rights in Cambodia&quot;, co-implemented by UNESCO, UNDP and OHCHR, with funding from the UNPRPD Disability Fund.</narrative>
  </description>
